      "sourceTextSha256": "0c0ddc8ef46f69b3693dda64a88b8b79d05fd13ec397486f40091f9b961d0609",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel and transfer to the city of Cartagena. Approximate duration: 04 hours. Welcome Arrival at the Hotel for your respective Check-In.\n\nIn the afternoon tour by the residential areas of Bocagrande, Castillogrande, and Manga. Arrival at the Cima de la Popa, where we will have a panoramic view of the city. Guided visit to the convent and church. Guided visit to the San Felipe de Barajas Castle, the most important military engineering work of Spain in America and which protected the city from pirate attacks. At the end of this visit, we will return to the hotel along Santander Avenue where we can appreciate the bastions and walls of the historic center; we will visit Las Bóvedas craft center. In the afternoon we will return to the hotel. \n\nIncludes: transport, guide, entrance fees, and local medical assistance card.\n\nDuration: 04 hours. Days of Operation: every day",
