    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:936a34ccc6e7c635",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "614737388a1fbbeb457eb003254dfa2288b9359afaa7eba927a8b2087c3c638e",
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Daily departure: 08:30 hours *Departure from Marina Santa Cruz dock: 08:00 hours -full Day on the islands to enjoy its crystal clear waters. There we can go scuba diving or snorkeling (additional cost). At the Pegasos Pier, you will board a speedboat or yacht, with a panoramic tour of the Bay of Cartagena and Bocachica, where you can admire a beautiful landscape with the old forts of San Fernando and San Jose. Navigating along the coast of Baru Island we will reach the base island in the Rosario Islands. Free time to enjoy the sea and the facilities. Return to the hotel in Cartagena.\n\nIncludes: Tour by the set of islands, typical lunch and assistance card, transfer Hotel /Port/ Hotel\n\nDuration: 8 hours. - Days of Operation: Every day.\n\nNot Included: Sailing and Coralia taxes U$10 per person, Oceanarium entrance U$10 per person.",
